            B.q("sa-m3-23", "sa-nonrelational", "The app stores people and who follows whom, and must answer questions like 'friends of friends who like jazz' quickly. Which Cosmos DB API fits best?", listOf("Azure Cosmos DB for Apache Gremlin", "Azure Cosmos DB for Table", "Azure Cosmos DB for Apache Cassandra", "Azure Blob Storage"), setOf(0), "The Gremlin API stores data as a graph: vertices for things such as people, and edges for relationships such as follows. Traversals like friends of friends are what graph queries do well.",
