            B.q("sa-m3-25", "sa-nonrelational", "Images uploaded in Europe must be copied automatically to a storage account in Australia so Australian users load them from nearby. What do you recommend?", listOf("Read-access geo-redundant storage on the European account, reading from the secondary", "Object replication from the European account to an account in Australia", "AzCopy run by an engineer each day from the European account to Australia", "A lifecycle management rule that copies new blobs to an account in Australia"), setOf(1), "Object replication copies block blobs asynchronously from a source account to a destination account you choose, in any region. It needs blob versioning on both accounts and the change feed on the source.",
